RUNZ","AEZ"],["STATEZ","VERTEXZ","OBSZ"],["CICDZ","NET"]],"RUNZ":[["APP","PUSH"],["CONS","CHATCLI"],["AGENT"],["QUERY","ADMINT"]],"STATEZ":"grid3","OBSZ":"grid2","CICDZ":"row","SSMPROJ":"row","OUT":"column","AWSZ":[["GITHUBZ","GITLABZ"],["JENKINS","JFROG"]],"GITHUBZ":"row","GITLABZ":"column"}},"caption":"Source of truth: this repository at `main` @667529f (`genair-infra-factory/`, `src/agents/ragengine-agent/`). A Google Chat app\npublishes to the Pub/Sub topic `hrpn-gchat-events`; a push subscription with an OIDC token of the pod service account calls\n`/gchat-push` on Cloud Run `hrpn-ragengine-agent`, a FastAPI app from ADK `get_fast_api_app` that also serves the ADK web UI (CORS `*`).\nThe route answers 200 first, then a background task runs the `LlmAgent` (gemini-2.5-flash, generic `GenAiR_RAG_Agent` prompt) on\nVertex AI RAG Engine (RagManaged Basic, corpus `hr_policies`) and replies through the Chat REST API.\nRed frames: Chat sessions in `InMemorySessionService` keyed by the space name (lost on restart, shared in group spaces), no event check\nor dedup, corpus admin tools callable by any user, user text logged at INFO; absent: citations, 1–5 feedback, eligibility check, Drive sync.\nTwo runtimes coexist: Agent Engine `hrpn-ae-ragengine-agent` (AdkApp, Terraform) is deployed but no Chat path calls it (deployed state verified 2026-10-19: engine 6891800455551123456 beside Cloud Run revision `00005-fqc`; the out-of-Terraform LB backend `hrpn-gchat-push-backend` exists, unused by the push subscription, which targets the `*.run.app` URL).\nTemplate bricks without a consumer (bucket, Firestore, Phoenix, feedback sink) stay visible as dormant. End-to-end delivery: `unknown` after the 2026-10-12 commits (org policy `iam.allowedPolicyMemberDomains` blocked earlier paths).\nPlatform inheritance: GenAiR-Cutter 26.9.0 (github.airbus.corp, AgentGarden as submodule) generated the repo and pushed it to the POD SSM repository `prj-ssm-b967/hr-polnav-c700-repo`; Terraform reads the genair-infra-factory modules from their SSM mirror; Cloud Build (same POD project) deploys on the SSM webhook. Everything runs in POD: the PROD mode of the template (`app_code`, dev/int/pro projects, Jenkins on AWS with WIF) was not run, and no HRPN repository on the Airbus SCM (GitLab / GitHub) was found (red frames).","sceneHash":"a326e51ca1f5e6946b42d8792e1e352ca6a3a8190520d91f0a2f020eb3c473e3"},{"id":"S2-target","title":"Option 2 decided target · Pub/Sub → Cloud Run single runtime","pair":"option","date":"2026-10-15","source":"flowchart LR\n  subgraph PEOPLE[\"Users and operators\"]\n    EMP[\"HR users and employees\"]\n    DEV[\"HRPN developers\"]\n    HRADM[\"HR content owners\"]\n  end\n  subgraph WS[\"Google Workspace\"]\n    CHAT[\"Google Chat app\"]\n    DRIVE[\"HR policy Drive folder\"]\n  end\n  subgraph GCP[\"Google Cloud Platform\"]\n    subgraph PRODZ[\"PROD landing zone · app_code (to provision)\"]\n      subgraph PPROZ[\"HRPN pro project · project_id_pro\"]\n        subgraph MSGZ[\"Pub/Sub\"]\n          TOPIC[\"Chat events topic\"]\n          SUB[\"Push subscription\"]\n        end\n        subgraph RUNZ[\"Cloud Run hrpn-ragengine-agent\"]\n          APP[\"FastAPI server\"]\n          AGENT[\"ADK agent and RAG tools\"]\n          CHATAPI[\"Google Chat API integration\"]\n        end\n        subgraph STATEZ[\"Storage and state\"]\n          DOCS[\"Policy documents bucket\"]\n          FS[\"Firestore sessions database\"]\n        end\n        subgraph VERTEXZ[\"Vertex AI\"]\n          RAG[\"RAG Engine corpus\"]\n          GEM[\"Gemini\"]\n          ARMOR[\"Model Armor\"]\n        end\n        subgraph INGZ[\"Ingestion\"]\n          SYNC[\"Drive sync job\"]\n          IMPORT[\"RAG import job\"]\n        end\n      end\n      subgraph PSHARED[\"PROD shared projects\"]\n        subgraph PCICD[\"CI/CD · project_id_cicd\"]\n          PSSM[\"PROD SSM repository\"]\n          PAR[\"PROD Artifact Registry\"]\n          PIAC[\"IaC service account and WIF\"]\n          PLIBS[\"Shared libraries project\"]\n        end\n        subgraph OBSZ[\"Observability\"]\n          CLOG[\"Conversation audit log\"]\n          LOGS[\"Log bucket 1 year\"]\n          BQ[\"BigQuery linked dataset\"]\n          PHX[\"Phoenix tracing\"]\n        end\n        PSVPC[\"Shared VPC host\"]\n      end\n    end\n  end\n  subgraph OUT[\"AWS\"]\n    subgraph GITHUBZ[\"Airbus GitHub · github.airbus.corp\"]\n      subgraph GENSRC[\"GenAiR sources\"]\n        CUTTER[\"GenAiR-Cutter\"]\n        AGARDEN[\"GenAiR-AgentGarden\"]\n        IFREPO[\"genair-infra-factory\"]\n        GLIBS[\"GenAiR libraries\"]\n      end\n    end\n    subgraph GITLABZ[\"Airbus GitLab · SCM\"]\n      SCMREPO[\"HRPN repository on SCM\"]\n    end\n    subgraph AWSCI[\"CI/CD\"]\n      JENKINS[\"Jenkins\"]\n      JFROG[\"JFrog Artifactory\"]\n    end\n  end\n  EMP -->|\"message or @mention\"| CHAT\n  CHAT -->|\"publish · Chat agent\"| TOPIC\n  TOPIC -->|\"push subscription\"| SUB\n  SUB -->|\"OIDC push · dedicated SA\"| CHATAPI\n  CHATAPI -->|\"eligible question\"| AGENT\n  AGENT -->|\"sessions · history\"| FS\n  AGENT -->|\"screen prompt and answer\"| ARMOR\n  AGENT -->|\"LLM call\"| GEM\n  AGENT -->|\"retrieval_query\"| RAG\n  CHATAPI -->|\"answer + rating card\"| CHAT\n  CHATAPI -->|\"feedback_score\"| LOGS\n  CHATAPI -->|\"scrubbed log entry\"| CLOG\n  CLOG -->|\"sink · 365 d\"| LOGS\n  LOGS -->|\"linked dataset\"| BQ\n  HRADM -->|\"approved documents\"| DRIVE\n  DRIVE -->|\"Drive API · read-only\"| SYNC\n  SYNC -->|\"delta copy\"| DOCS\n  DOCS -->|\"new objects\"| IMPORT\n  IMPORT -->|\"import_files · delta\"| RAG\n  AGARDEN -->|\"submodule src/agent_garden\"| CUTTER\n  CUTTER -->|\"copier generate --prod · update\"| SCMREPO\n  GLIBS -->|\"builds\"| JENKINS\n  JENKINS -->|\"genair-* packages\"| JFROG\n  DEV -->|\"git push · PROD\"| SCMREPO\n  SCMREPO -->|\"webhook on push\"| JENKINS\n  IFREPO -->|\"TF modules (PROD)\"| JENKINS\n  PLIBS -->|\"GenAiR libs (PROD)\"| JENKINS