 grant.\nDelivery (hypothesis): the ADK code keeps its GenAiR-Cutter / AgentGarden origin, lives on the Airbus SCM and reaches the platform through the Airbus CI/CD (the AgentAiR constraint list says \"CI/CD of Airbus (Gitlab, Jenkins …) tbc\"); the spoke environments (dev / int / pro) and their project ids are unknown.","sceneHash":"5d944d5441bc0a94c83f6ed78c1e050ba12b43b08bcb4fc65ce1475d13abf55f"}],"manifest":{"schema":"hrpn-architecture-scenes/v1","scenes":"docs/architecture/hrpn/SCENES.md","scenesHash":"224bcaac70e397e771d88273219483eea808c0aa31cdcdc6d61d47f645d94853","metadataHash":"85de8a950c66312bd1f519ea2cc04aa37dff4bf9f6f0d39e34252fd95e2b6d51","chain":"docs/architecture/tooling/chain (copy of the D2D Focus chain, see tooling/PROVENANCE.md)","geometry":"Zone layout (north/south/flows), orthogonal router of the chain, single card template A 460 x 200.","graphOrder":["S2-asbuilt","S2-target","S1-conversational","S3-agentfactory"],"graphs":[{"id":"S2-asbuilt","title":"Option 2 as built · HRPN main @667529f (2026-10-12)","sceneHash":"a326e51ca1f5e6946b42d8792e1e352ca6a3a8190520d91f0a2f020eb3c473e3","nodes":41,"edges":44,"subflows":17,"canvas":{"width":4864,"height":4124}},{"id":"S2-target","title":"Option 2 decided target · Pub/Sub → Cloud Run single runtime","sceneHash":"81183292b8249aa25776768ba505e1b46b95d9a9a6fd2e5610efb247691bcef3","nodes":33,"edges":31,"subflows":18,"canvas":{"width":5380,"height":3980}},{"id":"S1-conversational","title":"Option 1 · Conversational Agent (PoC-equivalent)","sceneHash":"9d68d35baf4bdd8a5bf6ec55a87c9a48bbc84a6018f028e21f048c57d8a95884","nodes":23,"edges":24,"subflows":17,"canvas":{"width":3670,"height":3324}},{"id":"S3-agentfactory","title":"Option 3 hypothesis · Agent Factory (AgentAiR)","sceneHash":"5d944d5441bc0a94c83f6ed78c1e050ba12b43b08bcb4fc65ce1475d13abf55f","nodes":37,"edges":36,"subflows":15,"canvas":{"width":4678,"height":3980}}]}}